I've just recalled an even more sneaky plan.  I didn't invent this scam,
and I can't remember who did, but I'll post it anyway :-)

You need:

 1) polymorph and polymorph control
 2) a charm spell (or maybe a scroll of taming)
 3) a temple

You do:

 1) donate 400 * <your level> in gold to the priest, and enjoy your
	improved armour class;

 2) polymorph yourself into a leprechaun;

 3) go and steal your gold back from the priest;

 4) cast a charm (or taming) on the priest - this will placate him
	again;

 5) repeat until you're a walking tank :-)

